# L171: witnessed work-sum KAT for the u128 chain-work law
# (law landed in 0c7c9e594). Work constants derived by rustc driver
# against generated/consensus_engine.rs (block_work / chain_work),
# not asserted. Difficulty 63 present per KAT spec; work saturates
# per-block at 2^127 by law but 63 << 127 so exact.
